  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping Help Guide\n\n### Adding and Creating Sales Quotations \n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 23 Aug, 2021 at 12:47 PM\n\n### Navigation - Bookkeeping > Click client >Dashboard > +Quote\n\nWatch the video here\n\nHere's more on how to create a quote\n\nHelp/Guide \n\n### It lets the user create a Quotation to be provided to a Customer.\n\n### The Quotations No. column shows the various Quotations created. As you click on this a Quotation Details popup will appear where you may view the details and click on PDF icon to download the same. The next column shows the Name of Customer. The Date and Amount column show the Particular date and total amount of the Quotation which is created.\n\nThe Action Dropdown lets you take the following Actions:\n\n - Edit\n\n - Delete\n\n - Download PDF\n\n - Email\n\n - Create Invoice\n\nThis Page contains a ‘Quotation’ button which is listed on the upper left corner of the page. As you click on this button it will redirect you to Create New Quotation page. You may also Export the Quotations so made by clicking on the ‘Export’ button listed on upper right navigation.\n\n### \n\n### Creating Quotes\n\n### \n\n### Viewing Quotes\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000185558\">Bookkeeping Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Adding and Creating Sales Quotations \n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 23 Aug, 2021 at 12:47 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"><strong>Navigation</strong> - Bookkeeping &gt; Click client &gt;Dashboard &gt; +Quote</span></h3><p><br></p><p><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/49278209bd914430a9dd7e3678be096e\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Watch the video here</strong></a></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/f2715100346d400f8ed0cbbc3e245c5b\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><br></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/f2715100346d400f8ed0cbbc3e245c5b\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Here's more on how to create a quote</strong></span></a></p><p><br></p><p><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><u style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Help/Guide</u>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><br></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">I<span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">t lets the user create a Quotation to be provided to a Customer.</span></h3><p><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">The Quotations No. column shows the various Quotations created. As you click on this a Quotation Details popup will appear where you may view the details and click on PDF icon to download the same. The next column shows the Name of Customer. The Date and Amount column show the Particular date and total amount of the Quotation which is created.<br><br>The Action Dropdown lets you take the following Actions:</span></h3><ul><li><p dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Edit</span></p></li><li><p dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Delete</span></p></li><li><p dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Download PDF</span></p></li><li><p dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Email</span></p></li><li><p dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Create Invoice</span></p></li></ul><p><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">This Page contains a ‘Quotation’ button which is listed on the upper left corner of the page. As you click on this button it will redirect you to Create New Quotation page. You may also Export the Quotations so made by clicking on the ‘Export’ button listed on upper right navigation.</span></p><h4 dir=\"ltr\"><br></h4><h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Creating Quotes</strong></span></h4><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9073924485/original/KD8cvprswaZaBxqjlZMJVMy1GwE--7c6lg.png?1553180693\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9073924485/original/KD8cvprswaZaBxqjlZMJVMy1GwE--7c6lg.png?1553180693\" data-fileid=\"9073924485\" data-uniquekey=\"1553180625477\" style=\"width: 964px;\"></span></p><h4 dir=\"ltr\"><br></h4><h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Viewing Quotes</strong></span></h4><p><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"fr-unprocessed\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9073924486/original/SFYM7xu7Ebmnfw05cnkY3yaTfF6poZZrBw.png?1553180693\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9073924486/original/SFYM7